    { "id": "rule_guidance", "blockType": "description", "content": { "zh-CN": "<h3>关单前置校验</h3><p>生效规则按顺序在同一事务内执行。规则只使用经过审计的结构化条件，不接受脚本或原始表达式；失败时商机保持原状态。</p>", "en": "<h3>Pre-close validation</h3><p>Active rules run in order within the close transaction. Only audited structured validations are supported; scripts and raw expressions are not accepted. A failure leaves the opportunity unchanged.</p>" } },
